docs/plans/2026-06-17-003-fix-twofield-compliant-density-projection-plan.md:96:- `src/solvers/twofield/mod.rs` — `dbg.w` mode flag (a free uniform `Params` lane; 256-byte layout unchanged, no new storage buffer) + `set_density_target_mode_for_test`.
