docs/plans/2026-06-17-003-fix-twofield-compliant-density-projection-plan.md:203:- **Corner-seam `WALL_BC_MULTI` + pour-pocket patch retirement** — a separate later plan, once this fix's effect on the corner audit (`corner_parity_multi_drops_to_box`) and the R11 model-isolation gate is measured. Not retired here; the patches stay behind their `dbg.y` selector (off by default), unaffected by this work.
